<title>USA: GTI Corp names Myers as new CFO.</title>
<headline>GTI Corp names Myers as new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTI Corp on Wednesday said it has named Bruce Myers as its vice president and chief financial officer, replacing Douglas Downs who resigned in November 1996.</p>
<p>Myers' appointment is effective immediately, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>From June 1989 through December 1996, Myers was chief operating officer and chief financial officer of Xscribe Corp, a developer and manufacturer of technology products.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Xscribe, Myers spent 11 years with accounting firm Arthur Andersen &amp; Co.</p>
